    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zēa</span></b> , ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζειἀ</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of grain</i>, <i>spelt</i>:
			Triticum spelta, Linn. (pure Lat. alica); <i><span class="en">Plin. 18,
				8, 19, § 81 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hier. in
				Isa. 9, 28, 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. in Ezech. 4,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of rosemary</i>, <i><span class="en">App.
				Herb. 97</span></i>.</div>
